<title>PORTUGAL: Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank issues Navigator.</title>
<headline>Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank issues Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank is launching a 2.0 billion escudo variable-rate Navigator issue, lead manager Banco Santander de Negocios Portugal (BSNP) said.</p>
<p>BSNP said the 'Lisbor Capped Accrual Notes' would have a three-year maturity with a coupon indexed to three-month Lisbor plus 75 basis points for every day three-month Lisbor remained below 8.25 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;If on one day Lisbor rose above this level, the investor would only lose that day's interest,&quot; BSNP said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
